    Re-grade verdict b99a1a4e: all five criteria graded PASS live (21 passed;
    MON5-B/C/D one-liners exit 0 with exact expected stdout; docs grep == 7) but
    the coverage gate could not align the four long wrapped criterion texts
    (graded under short B/C/D/E labels vs full yaml text) and declared them
    ungraded -> overall FAIL. Fix: move the evaluator-proven one-liners verbatim
    into scripts/mon5_checks.sh (subcommands a-e) and reference the wrapper from
    five short criteria so judge text == yaml text.
    
